The '''Office of Acquisitions''' was a shop located on the ''[[Colossus]]'', a fueling station located on the [[planet]] [[Castilon]], and owned by [[Orka]] and [[Flix]]. They supplied [[pilot]]s and mechanics, like [[Team Fireball|Team ''Fireball'']], with ship parts of various quality. They also sponsored [[Hype Fazon]] and his ship, ''[[Green Ace]]''. Flix and Orka were assisted in their job by [[G-LN]], a [[DUM-series pit droid|pit droid]].<ref name="GLN DB">{{Databank|g-ln|G-LN}}</ref> Each partner focused on an aspect of their operation: Orka did the bartering, while Flix took care of book-keeping.<ref name="Flix DB">{{Databank|flix|Flix}}</ref><ref name="Orka DB">{{Databank|orka|Orka}}</ref> The shop had a trapdoor located just inside the entrance, which unwary thieves would usually find themselves dumped down.<ref name="When Thieves Drop By">{{Resistance|When Thieves Drop By}}</ref>

{{Struct-stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
In "[[Dangerous Business]],"<ref name="Dangerous">{{Resistance|Dangerous Business}}</ref> the thirteenth episode of ''[[Star Wars Resistance]]'s'' [[Star Wars Resistance Season One|first season]],<ref name="DBAirdate">{{DisneyPress|wdtv=1|url=disneychannel/shows/star-wars-resistance/episodes|text=Star Wars Resistance}}</ref> the sign above the Office of Acquisitions' door has two labels reading "Open" and "Closer" in [[Aurebesh]].<ref name="Dangerous" /> The latter is likely meant to say "Closed" and instead says "Closer" by mistake, due to the close resemblance between the Aurebesh letters for "d" and "r."

